## Section Nav for ChatGPT

This plugin reuses and adapts source code, component structure, CSS, and
behavior from **Section Nav for ChatGPT** by scandishoper:

- Repository: https://github.com/scandishoper/Section-Nav-for-ChatGPT
- License: MIT
- Copyright: Copyright (c) 2026 scandishoper

The adapted portions include the ChatGPT section parser, answer/section
trackers, rail placement, bookmark storage and resolver, recovery helper, and
the rail/drawer React components. The ChatGPT DOM adapter and extension
manifest were replaced with a DeepSeek Harness adapter and a `dsh` bundle
manifest.

See `LICENSE` for the full MIT permission notice applicable to those portions.
